**Troy Goode owns the most surviving code, and Douglas Christopher Wilson is second.** I counted lines at HEAD with `git blame`, not commits.

The latest commit, `62628c0` ("reformat js with 4-space indent and double quotes"), is by Fiona Formatter. A plain blame credits her with 291 lines. I excluded that commit with `--ignore-revs-file` and used `-w -M -C`, so whitespace changes and moved or copied lines go to the original author.

